1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,200
Even a heart needs a breakfast break!

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:08,200
Forty grams of oats, two hundred mils of water, half a banana.

3
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:12,200
Tip the oats and water into a small pan.

4
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:17,200
Bring to a simmer. Stir over low heat until soft.

5
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:21,200
While it cooks, slice the banana.

6
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:25,000
Spoon into a bowl, add banana, and breakfast is ready!

7
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:30,200
Oats bring soluble fiber to a heart-friendly breakfast.

8
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:34,200
The banana brings the sweetness. No added sugar here!

9
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:37,691
Wait. My breakfast, and you get to eat it?

10
00:00:37,891 --> 00:00:42,291
Subscribe for your employee badge, and like for overtime pay!
